- description: Code quality queries ABOM runs against its own browser code

# Pinned for the reason abom-go-quality.qls states. Vendored minified libraries need no exclusion
# here: measured 2026-09-10, the JavaScript extractor skips *.min.js by itself, so 1.3 MB of
# vendored code never reaches these queries.
- import: codeql-suites/javascript-security-and-quality.qls
  from: codeql/javascript-queries
  version: 2.4.7
